# 中频词汇 List08
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List08核心词汇

{{dose}}{/dəʊs/}{剂量；一剂}{The doctor prescribed a low dose of the medication.}}
{{draft}}{/drɑːft/}{草稿；草案}{The committee reviewed the first draft of the proposal.}}
{{drama}}{/ˈdrɑːmə/}{戏剧；剧本}{The political drama unfolded on live television.}}
{{dramatic}}{/drəˈmætɪk/}{戏剧性的；显著的}{There has been a dramatic increase in online sales.}}
{{drift}}{/drɪft/}{漂流；趋势}{The conversation drifted to unrelated topics.}}
{{due}}{/djuː/}{到期的；由于}{The report is due by the end of the week.}}
{{durable}}{/ˈdjʊərəbl/}{耐用的；持久的}{This material is highly durable and waterproof.}}
{{duration}}{/djʊˈreɪʃn/}{持续时间}{The duration of the course is six months.}}
{{dynamic}}{/daɪˈnæmɪk/}{动态的；有活力的}{The city has a dynamic and diverse economy.}}
{{eager}}{/ˈiːɡər/}{渴望的；热切的}{She is eager to learn new skills.}}
{{elaborate}}{/ɪˈlæbərət/}{精心制作的；详细阐述}{The professor elaborated on the theory in her lecture.}}
{{election}}{/ɪˈlekʃn/}{选举；当选}{The presidential election attracted record voter turnout.}}
{{electronic}}{/ˌɪlekˈtrɒnɪk/}{电子的}{Electronic devices have become essential in modern life.}}
{{elegant}}{/ˈelɪɡənt/}{优雅的；精美的}{She wore an elegant dress to the gala.}}
{{eliminate}}{/ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt/}{消除；淘汰}{We must eliminate waste to improve efficiency.}}
{{embrace}}{/ɪmˈbreɪs/}{拥抱；接受}{The company decided to embrace new technology.}}
{{emerge}}{/ɪˈmɜːdʒ/}{出现；浮现}{New evidence emerged during the investigation.}}
{{emission}}{/ɪˈmɪʃn/}{排放；散发}{The factory reduced its carbon emissions by 30%.}}
{{emotion}}{/ɪˈməʊʃn/}{情感；情绪}{Music has the power to stir deep emotions.}}
{{emphasis}}{/ˈemfəsɪs/}{强调；重点}{The report places emphasis on sustainable development.}}
{{empire}}{/ˈempaɪər/}{帝国；大企业}{The Roman Empire was one of the largest in history.}}
{{enable}}{/ɪˈneɪbl/}{使能够；使可能}{Technology enables people to work from anywhere.}}
{{encounter}}{/ɪnˈkaʊntər/}{遭遇；邂逅}{She encountered many difficulties during the project.}}
{{engage}}{/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒ/}{从事；吸引}{The teacher uses games to engage students in learning.}}
{{enormous}}{/ɪˈnɔːməs/}{巨大的；庞大的}{The project requires an enormous amount of funding.}}
{{enterprise}}{/ˈentəpraɪz/}{企业；事业}{Small enterprises play a key role in the economy.}}
{{enthusiasm}}{/ɪnˈθjuːziæzəm/}{热情；热心}{Her enthusiasm for the project inspired the whole team.}}
{{entire}}{/ɪnˈtaɪər/}{整个的；全部的}{The entire team worked overtime to meet the deadline.}}
{{entity}}{/ˈentəti/}{实体；存在}{The company is a separate legal entity.}}
{{environment}}{/ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt/}{环境；自然环境}{Protecting the environment is everyone's responsibility.}}
